"""@@NAME@@ -- pk25 (code/pk25/asm/): P3, H-CONN's factored MR_CRUDEX (the rows 4560, 4640, 4681, 4686, 4697, 4718; pk25/P3_NOTE_v1.md
and D2_DESIGN_v1 to v1_3). v3 (asm/src/kt_s9h_p3_v3.py.in
fb29ff97) = v2 (a1903674: P3a's window rows below J_s, PART window, and P3b's Lemma D rows on the finite pieces above J_s, PART lemd) with
