R1 is not 0): |Q v_h| <= |P_e v_h| <= |Q_W v_h| + sum_k |<u~_k, v_h>| L_k (Lemma P), |Q_W v_h| <= |uhat_0p| (A_h/(1 - eps_r) + |c_h| Rb_0) +
sum_(b = 1, 3) |uhat_0b| C + C delta_0, with A_h/t by P2's re_over_t ported to M4H's hook kind h (re_over_t_h: hf = 2J far weights, M0 out
of nP, the bridge sum_g |delta_g| nu_g with m0* exact (delta_h) and the NU record; C-MONO-M4H on every J-weighted term) and Rb_0/t =
(eps_r/t)/(1 - eps_r(J_lo)) (eps_over_t, C-MONO-M2B). Plants PLANT-MONO-H (J_lo = 1 in the monotonicity tests) and PLANT-TIE-H.
