-FAR-<item> for each of the ten far items FARH, C-FAR-NAMES checking the reader's list); each PLANT-MONO-<term> sets J = 1 in its own test
only and counts only when that term's gate refuses (PLANT-MONO-H is withdrawn). Nothing else changes.
