in place of the constant stand-in; C-SQ2 on its rows; MODE cert (PART full only): pk23's CW_X11 STATUS CERTIFIED (load_cw), no stand-in
left, the record to pk25/mr/v6/MR_CRUDEX.kv with STATUS CERTIFIED (a dry run's to asm/dry_<TAG>/).
v7 = v6 (asm/src/kt_s9h_p3_v6.py.in 59d26616) with the P3b-1 note N-3 (the row
4772), the P4 N-1 in this engine: Lambda = mu_0,rec theta converts E4's T10,b and IhR,10,b into S units only because S8 N's T,b,c
(from which mu_0,rec is formed), E4's T10,b (built from those same S8 N items) and the E4N record's IhR,10,b share one main, main_N. Input
gate C-MAIN-E4 at both N: E4's sources name the pinned S8 N record; S8 N's record has graph N; the E4N record has graph E4N, names the
pinned c3k entry list, and that list defines E4N as the N graph (columns vac, int, vac) with h on the bond next to one end column; the E4N
and N families carry equal prep parameters (a_v, ap, theta0). PLANT-MAIN-E4 puts S8 D's record in the T slot and must be refused.
Lemma D on P = span{u_x, u_y, z}, z = Q_e chi/|Q_e chi|, chi = the stored state 10' (P3_NOTE_v1 sect. 1-5), per piece above J_s, every
quantity in first-order form X(t) = x0 + t x1 (class Sl: x0 a ball of the true t^0 value, x1 a ball of (X(t) - x0)/t over the piece's t
range; products, quotients, powers and square roots by the exact difference rules; an O(t) bar B with |B| <= b t is Sl(0, [-b, b])):
- leaves: P2's certified table (uhat_kb slopes on UHAT0, delta_a/t = (2 (q_a/t^2 + sum_k eps_ka/t^2))^1/2, rho_k/t, L_k/t, q_a/t); the S8
  laws g,b,c (S8 D), T,b,c (S8 N), e,b (S8 E2) by P2's entry_x1 form with C-A0 (x0 = C10's exact G0, T0); E4's G10,b, T10,b, IhR,10,b and
  E6's E6e (x0 the record's t0 ball, x1 its c1); on a finite piece a record ball X with exact t^0 value X0 gives x1 = (X - X0)/[t_lo, t_hi]
