  from MR_JOINT; theta = Lambda/mu_0,rec in [1, 1/m0lo]), with X0 from C10 and C13; v_x = t xc (MR_INSERT v5b's xc).
- W_ext = span{psi-hat, e1, e3, chi} in the basis (u~_0, u~_x, u~_y, chi''), chi' = chi - sum_k g_k u~_k, g_k = <u~_k, chi>, chi'' =
  chi'/|chi'|, |chi'|^2 = n2 = G_cc - sum g_k^2 > 0 (C-ALPHA): S's compression is the arrowhead [[diag(mu), b], [b^T, d]] with
  b_k = (tv_k - g_k mu_k)/n2^1/2 (b_k(0) = 0 exactly), d = (T_cc - 2 sum g_k tv_k + sum g_k^2 mu_k)/n2, tv_k = <u~_k, S chi> = sum_b c_kb
  T10,b/Lambda, T_cc = T10,10/Lambda, c_kb = uhat_kb/|psi_b|, |psi_b|^2 = g,b,b, Lambda = mu_0,rec theta (E7_NOTE_v1's kappa = 1/Lambda),
  mu_0,rec the Rayleigh quotient of u~_0 on the records' (T, G). Its lowest eigenpair (nu_xy, r_xy) is explicit: for d < min mu_k the secular
  function has one root below min mu_k, nu_xy in [d - sum b_k^2/(mu_k - d), d], r_xy = (sum_k gamma_k u~_k + chi'')/(1 + sum gamma_k^2)^1/2,
  gamma_k = b_k/(nu_xy - mu_k) (C-ARROW: d below every mu_k).
- chi = alpha r_xy + sum_k beta_k u~_k, alpha = n2^1/2 (1 + sum gamma_k^2)^1/2 > 0, beta_k = g_k - n2^1/2 gamma_k, so Q_e chi - alpha r_xy =
  -alpha Pi_e r_xy + sum_k beta_k Q_e u~_k with |Q_e u~_k| <= L_k (Lemma P, MR_LEMMAP's L_k), |<u_a, r_xy>| <= q_a rho_xy/(s_a - nu_xy)
  (res_xy is orthogonal to W_ext and |Q_ext u_a| <= |Q_W u_a| <= q_a), rho_xy <= (sum_k |gamma_k| rho_k + (R_xy |chi| + sum_k |g_k| rho_k)/
  n2^1/2)/(1 + sum gamma_k^2)^1/2 (|Q_ext S u~_k| <= rho_k); e_z = 2 eta/alpha (P3_NOTE_v1 sect. 4's lemma with the basis {r_xy, u~_k} for
  the complement of r_xy in W_ext in place of W_ext's other Ritz vectors); nu_z = nu_xy -+ (2 e_z rho_xy + 2 e_z^2), c <= rho_xy + e_z (1 +
  2 rho_xy + 2 e_z); g_z = <r_xy, eps(-1)> -+ e_z R_w with <u~_k, eps(-1)> = c_k(-1) -+ delta_k R_w (0 for k = 0), <chi, eps(-1)> =
  (E6e/A~_0)(1 -+ (delta_0 R_w + delta_0^2/2)) - (g_0 -+ |chi| delta_0), A~_0 = sum_b c_0b e,b; k_z = <r_xy, S M_c u~_x> -+ C (e_z + delta_x),
  eta_z = <r_xy, S M_c u~_0> -+ C (e_z + delta_0) with <u~_k, S M_c u~_a> = s_k m_ka -+ C (delta_k + delta_a) (m_0x = v_x, m_0y = v_y, m_00 = 0)
  and <chi, S M_c u~_a> = sum_b c_ab (IhR,10,b - c_h T10,b)/Lambda (E4N's IhR,10,b = Lambda <chi, S M_h chi_b>, C-IHR; c_h MR_JOINT's).
  The orientation: r_xy along chi'', so z(0) = sgn(A) u_xy0 (C10's C-PURE10 A for the stored 10'), g_z0 = sgn(A) c_x(-1)0 c_y(-1)0, k_z0 =
  sgn(A) s_x0 s_y0 h_y0 (C13), nu_z0 = s_x0 s_y0; C-T0-Z checks each x0 ball holds its exact value, which is then used as x0.
- rows, d = 1..9: E^Pi/t = c_x(d) m_xx/t + c_y(d) m_xy/t - c_x(d)^2 xc + D_d/t - nu_z^d g_z c_x(d) eta_z/t, D_d = nu_z^d g_z k_z -
  c_x(d) c_y(d) v_y in first-order form (D_d(0) = 0 by C-PI0-EXACT; C-PI0: the x0 ball holds 0; D_d/t = its x1), eta_z(0) = 0;
  E^Q/t <= (C_w + |c_x(d)| Pevw/t) tau4^d pe, C_w = |w_1| (x1t + |c_h - c_h'| tau4 (sum delta^2)^1/2/t) + |w_0| (Pevw + C (delta_0 + sum_b
  |uhat_0b - uhat_0b(0)|))/t + |uhat_x3|/t C + C delta_x/t; E^R/t <= (N_x + |c_x(d)| N_u) R_w d (c/t) (s_x + c)^(d-1), N_x^2 = v_x^2 + s_x^2 m_xx^2
  + s_y^2 m_xy^2 + k_z^2 + (C_w t)^2, N_u^2 = s_x^2 v_x^2 + s_y^2 v_y^2 + eta_z^2 + Pevw^2. The envelope: env_r = s_x,hi + c_hi + 1/100 and
  env_delta0 = sum over the terms (A rho^d or A d rho^(d-1), every rho below env_r) of max_(d >= 10) term/env_r^(d+1) (the ratio of a d rho^(d-1)
  term rises only while d < rho/(env_r - rho), so the max is over a finite range). C-ORDER-P (nu_z, s_y, tau4 below s_x), C-ENV, C-SIGN.
